{"synopsis":"Ye Ning memperoleh “jari emas” melalui perjalanan, dan selama dia masih hidup, dia akan menjadi tak terkalahkan.\n\nJadi dia mulai bertindak gila. Tapi…\n\nPermaisuri Da Zhou: “Ketika aku melihat kehidupan Ye Ning, jika dia mati, aku akan hidup sendirian.”\n\nPenguasa abadi dunia atas: “Dunia ini begitu acuh tak acuh, tapi Tuan Ye tidak pernah membenciku, aku akan berusaha sekuat mungkin untuk melindunginya.”\n\nRatusan juta orang: “Setiap orang di dunia ini bisa kekurangan, tapi Tuan Ye adalah satu-satunya saint, hanya Ye Ning’er!”\n\nYe Ning: Aku hampir tak terkalahkan, mengapa kalian tidak membiarkanku mati?","alternative_title":"再不死我就统治魔界了","author":"阳光","artist":"绘世TONY","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"32c57d75-c0ec-478f-b79a-e4ac64c9a64d","number":"116","chapter":"116","title":"","date":"2026-06-27","released":"2026-06-27"},{"chapter_id":"b44b2b4d-c745-47a3-a878-5c638a2f3d7f","number":"115","chapter":"115","title":"","date":"2025-12-24","released":"2025-12-24"},{"chapter_id":"71cc4104-4f18-45f8-94f3-a505d3ce3727","number":"114","chapter":"114","title":"","date":"2025-12-21","released":"2025-12-21"},{"chapter_id":"37569d24-b883-4cf6-8cfc-52be7b882a07","number":"113","chapter":"113","title":"","date":"2025-12-07","released":"2025-12-07"},{"chapter_id":"d6ed4a44-4913-475b-8f23-3324d08dda65","number":"112","chapter":"112","title":"","date":"2025-12-07","released":"2025-12-07"},{"chapter_id":"8d91f0e2-a41d-4eeb-b178-1ea286f51b2b","number":"111","chapter":"111","title":"","date":"2025-12-04","released":"2025-12-04"},{"chapter_id":"4976fbe6-4950-491c-a50d-937b7f170e4e","number":"110","chapter":"110","title":"","date":"2025-12-03","released":"2025-12-03"},{"chapter_id":"3e7bd445-a69f-496a-9c48-d96525bfa84e","number":"109","chapter":"109","title":"","date":"2025-12-01","released":"2025-12-01"},{"chapter_id":"8ae2f451-bf74-4b7a-aa35-f1d543bc8027","number":"108","chapter":"108","title":"","date":"2025-11-22","released":"2025-11-22"},{"chapter_id":"8bae5069-db8a-4